      "sourceFact": "Original states “a,b는 1이 아닌 양수이고” (positive and not 1), gives log_a 3 + log_b 3 = 3 and (log_3 a)^2+(log_3 b)^2=7, and asks (log_a3)^3+(log_b3)^3. Printed choices: 18,20,21,25,27. It does not state a,b>1.",
      "mathematicalFinding": "Let x=log_a3, y=log_b3. Conditions imply x+y=3 and 1/x^2+1/y^2=7, so p=xy solves 7p^2+2p-9=0, giving p=1 or p=-9/7. Both are realizable by nonzero real x,y with sum 3, hence positive a=3^(1/x), b=3^(1/y), neither equal to 1. Requested x^3+y^3=27-9p is therefore 18 or 270/7. The condition has two valid output values and no unique listed response.",
